Subject: [PATCH] ss3ds: translate the Move Reminder / tutor overlay (overlay
 68)

Run 65: the Pokemon-menu Y (Move Tutor) opened the game's MoveRelearner app and aborted on [SS-MISSING] ov68_021E7618. Overlay 68 is all
assembly; the screen's touch-handler and key-handler functions are only reachable through its pointer tables, so the translator never
rooted them. Seed the whole overlay_68.s (as 0134 did for overlay 65) and drop the thirteen ov68 Missing() lines.
